REQUIRE final placements, selected symbol definitions, one relocation record
ENSURE the designated field is patched with a representable target-specific value
validate target section, symbol index, relocation kind, and explicit addend
determine field width from relocation kind
require offset within target and width no larger than remaining payload
reject overlapping fields under the case-study object contract
compute symbol address S and field address P
compute the relocation formula using defined checked arithmetic
enforce the relocation kind's signed or unsigned range rule
write exactly the field width in target byte order

